          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu odonjo i cawila pere to kidho Gosen romo gi bamere. Munyo joromo, Yozefu opodho i ŋuti bamere to ywak ma hongo mabor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
